                                  style: { "--framer-text-alignment": `justify` },
                                  children: `This project is done after the development of Cat Notes, and I could say that this game, What Stays Behind, have quite a resemblance with Cat Notes in the way the story is told through the rules of the stages in a form of a diary entry. However, due to the theme this game is following, the gameplay focuses on space management — making sure all required items fit into a set space in each stages.`,
