                                  dir: `auto`,
                                  style: { "--framer-text-alignment": `justify` },
                                  children: `The difficulty curve for this game is somewhat linear and straightforward, unlike Cat Notes. So naturally, the level design was not as complex as Cat Notes, since complexity can simply be added by adjusting the shape and sizes of the items and the bag. However, I still needed to line it up with the progression of the story, and each item needs to make sense with the situation given in the diary entry of a stage.`,
